    <item>
      <title>Talks and conferences</title>
      <link>/other/talks/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/other/talks/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;: 17 conference presentations across 10 conferences in 6 countries (2013–2025), of which 10 oral (including 1 invited), 6 posters and 1 speed talk. Plus 12 invited talks (7 seminars, 1 invited conference speaker, 4 invited outreach presentations) across 5 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;invited-seminars-and-lectures&#34;&gt;Invited seminars and lectures&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2025&lt;/strong&gt; — Altissime Voci Festival, Rimini, Italy (19/07/2025) — outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2024&lt;/strong&gt; — University of Padova, Biology Department, Italy (04/06/2024).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2024&lt;/strong&gt; — Swifts of Campiglia Festival, Italy (15/06/2024) — outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2024&lt;/strong&gt; — University of Strasbourg, Biology Department, France (15/02/2024).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2023&lt;/strong&gt; — Swiss Ornithological Institute, Switzerland (13/06/2023).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2023&lt;/strong&gt; — Carmagnola Swift&amp;rsquo;s Day, Italy (01/07/2023) — outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2023&lt;/strong&gt; — University of Ottawa, Biology Department, Canada (02/02/2023).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2023&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Women in Natural Sciences&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; — Piedmont Society of Natural Sciences (ANP, online, 07/02/2023) — outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2022&lt;/strong&gt; — University of Lausanne, Biology Department, Switzerland (24/05/2022).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2021&lt;/strong&gt; — Swiss Ornithological Institute, Switzerland (07/06/2021).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2021&lt;/strong&gt; — Bielefeld University, Biology Department, Germany (online, 13/01/2021).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;conference-presentations-as-presenting-author&#34;&gt;Conference presentations (as presenting author)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;recent-20232025&#34;&gt;Recent (2023–2025)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CIO Lecce&lt;/strong&gt; (Italy, Sep 2025) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Impact of extreme temperatures on an urban-nesting insectivorous bird, the Alpine swift&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EOU Bangor&lt;/strong&gt; (UK, Aug 2025) — Poster: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Impact of extreme climatic events on an urban-nesting insectivorous bird, the Alpine swift&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Swift Conference, Trieste&lt;/strong&gt; (Italy, May 2024) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Changes in body size and shape of Alpine swifts under climate change&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EOU Lund&lt;/strong&gt; (Sweden, Aug 2023) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Body size and shape change in aerial migrants under climate change&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;selected-earlier-presentations-international-reach-and-invited&#34;&gt;Selected earlier presentations (international reach and invited)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ESA-CSEE Montreal&lt;/strong&gt; (Canada, Aug 2022) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Demography, plasticity and microevolution drive body size and shape change&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQEBC Gatineau&lt;/strong&gt; (Canada, Nov 2021) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Nestling growth explains adult size change&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nordic Oikos Reykjavík&lt;/strong&gt; (Iceland, Mar 2020) — Oral: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Climate effects on pygmy owl food stores&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CIO Napoli&lt;/strong&gt; (Italy, Sep 2019) — &lt;strong&gt;Invited oral&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Climate change and pygmy owl food stores&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Ornithological Congress, Vancouver&lt;/strong&gt; (Canada, Aug 2018) — Speed talk: &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Food hoarding strategies&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;conference-organisation&#34;&gt;Conference organisation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scientific Committee&lt;/strong&gt; (4 times) — EOU conferences (Bangor 2025, Lund 2023); Italian Ornithology Congress (Lecce 2025, Varese 2023).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organising Committee&lt;/strong&gt; (2 times) — Italian Ornithology Congress (Torino 2017); 1st Meeting for Young Italian Ornithologists (Torino 2017).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Organising Committee&lt;/strong&gt; — EOU conference (Turku 2017).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Symposium organiser&lt;/strong&gt; (2 times):
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Avian shape in a warming world: unravelling the impact of temperature on bird morphology&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; — EOU Bangor 2025.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Phenotype and climate change: how are birds coping?&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; — EOU Lund 2023.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workshop organisation&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Advancing open, reliable, and transparent science — Insights from SORTEE&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;, EOU Bangor 2025 (co-organised with Matthieu Paquet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Online outreach event&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ciso-coi.it/en/attivita/le-donne-nellornitologia/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Women in Ornithology&lt;/a&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt; (CISO, 2021): co-organiser and host of a multi-session online lecture series highlighting women&amp;rsquo;s contributions to ornithological research and conservation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full list of presentations available on request.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
