    <item>
      <title>In the media</title>
      <link>/other/media/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/other/media/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Here you can see the impact that my research or some of my articles had in the media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;recent-features&#34;&gt;Recent features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2026&lt;/strong&gt;: Feature article in &lt;strong&gt;TierWelt&lt;/strong&gt; (Swiss nature and animal magazine) by Karin Schneeberger — &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.tierwelt.ch/artikel/wildtiere-zoo/die-alpensegler-im-turm-der-bieler-stadtkirche-556086&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Die Alpensegler im Turm der Bieler Stadtkirche&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; (23/07/2026, in German, subscription required) — on the Alpine swift colony in the bell tower of Biel&amp;rsquo;s town church. See also the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.facebook.com/reel/1045531807832875&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;accompanying video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2026&lt;/strong&gt;: Interview on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.raiplaysound.it/audio/2026/01/Radio3-Scienza-del-05012026-f66008f7-c688-4466-8e6e-c526084eee3f.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rai Radio3 Scienza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (05/01/2026) — discussing climate change and Alpine swifts (in Italian).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2025&lt;/strong&gt;: Feature article in &lt;strong&gt;SurseerWoche&lt;/strong&gt; (Swiss regional newspaper) — &lt;a href=&#34;https://avenue.argusdatainsights.ch/Article/AvenuePDFClip?artikelHash=232477b294924d5786ff2f274410d529_3A8DD8868F9FB35342271FFACA0D99FD&amp;artikelDateiId=451852252&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;link to the article&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;open-science&#34;&gt;Open Science&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2024&lt;/strong&gt;: Interview for the journal AvoinTiede by Elina Koivisto &lt;a href=&#34;https://avointiede.fi/en/news/sharing-gives-data-wings-and-posture&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Sharing data gives wings and posture&amp;rdquo; &lt;/a&gt; (In Finnish: &lt;a href=&#34;https://avointiede.fi/fi/ajankohtaista/avoin-jakaminen-antaa-aineistolle-siivet-ja-ryhtia-haastattelussa-giulia-masoero&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Link&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;). Secretariat for the National Open Science and Research Coordination. Federation of Finnish Learned Societies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;food-hoarding-of-pygmy-owls-and-weather-conditions&#34;&gt;Food-hoarding of pygmy owls and weather conditions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The publication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Masoero G, Laaksonen T, Morosinotto C, Korpimäki E (2020). &lt;a href=&#34;https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/gcb.15250&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Climate change and perishable food hoards of an avian predator: Is the freezer still working?&lt;/a&gt; Global Change Biology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video made by the journal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;iframe src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/yy9prv2Dm54&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; allowfullscreen title=&#34;YouTube Video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Press release of the University of Turku&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.utu.fi/en/news/press-release/climate-change-may-melt-the-freezers-of-pygmy-owls-and-reduce-their-overwinter&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Climate Change May Melt the “Freezers” of Pygmy Owls and Reduce Their Overwinter Survival&amp;rdquo; &lt;/a&gt; (In Finnish: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.utu.fi/fi/ajankohtaista/mediatiedote/ilmastonmuutos-voi-sulattaa-varpuspollojen-pakastimet-ja-lisata-pollojen&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Link&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nature Climate Change highlights by Tegan Armarego-Marriott&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-020-0903-0&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Owls’ hoards rot&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;British Ornithological Union (BOU) blog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://bou.org.uk/blog-masoero-pygmy-owl-climate-change-food-hoard/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Climate change and food-hoarding behaviour: is the freezer still working?&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Suomen Luonto article written by Elina Koivisto&lt;/strong&gt; (in Finnish): &lt;a href=&#34;https://suomenluonto.fi/artikkelit/vaimeneeko-varpuspollon-vihellys-ilmaston-ja-metsien-muuttuessa/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Vaimeneeko varpuspöllön vihellys ilmaston ja metsien muuttuessa?&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versus article written by Elina Koivisto&lt;/strong&gt; (in Finnish): &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.versuslehti.fi/kriittinen-tila/varpuspollon-pakastin-on-vaarassa-lakata-toimimasta/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Varpuspöllön pakastin on vaarassa lakata toimimasta&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co.Scienza&lt;/strong&gt; interview (In Italian): &lt;a href=&#34;https://open.spotify.com/episode/6JLE3wuBQZVvcOHVCHE01J?si=C_eGsOrIRriHwBnkbf5XtQ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Il rapporto preda-predatore&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Other activities</title>
      <link>/other/other_activities/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/other/other_activities/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Some of the other activities I am (or have been) involved in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;work-as-editor&#34;&gt;Work as Editor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editor&lt;/strong&gt; for the preprint server &lt;a href=&#34;https://ecoevorxiv.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;EcoEvoRxiv&lt;/a&gt; since January 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Associate Editor&lt;/strong&gt; for the journal &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.avocetta.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Avocetta&lt;/a&gt; (international ornithological journal) since October 2019.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Info on how to submit your manuscript can be found &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.avocetta.org/author-guidelines/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Member of the &lt;strong&gt;EcoEvoRxiv Committee&lt;/strong&gt; of the Society for Open, Reliable, and Transparent Ecology and Evolutionary Biology (&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sortee.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;SORTEE&lt;/a&gt;) — since 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Member of the &lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Outreach Committee&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sortee.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;SORTEE&lt;/a&gt; — since 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Member of the &lt;strong&gt;Conference Committee&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sortee.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;SORTEE&lt;/a&gt; — since 2024. Co-organised the 2024 SORTEE conference and the 2025 SORTEE workshop at EOU Bangor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.avocetta.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;














&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;d-flex justify-content-center&#34;&gt;
