&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;work-as-reviewer&#34;&gt;Work as Reviewer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grant reviewer&lt;/strong&gt; for the British Ecological Society (since January 2026).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Journal peer reviewer: &amp;gt;42 articles since 2016 across 19 journals including Ardea, Ardeola, Avian Research, Avocetta, Behavioral Ecology and Sociobiology, Biology Letters, Bird Study, Ecological Solutions and Evidence, Ecology and Evolution, Global Ecology and Conservation, Journal of Animal Ecology, Journal of Avian Biology, Ibis, North-Western Journal of Zoology, PLOS Climate, Oecologia, Ornis Fennica, Scientific Reports, The European Zoological Journal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A full record can be found on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/G-9512-2017&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;my Web of Science page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;work-in-scientific-societies&#34;&gt;Work in Scientific Societies&lt;/h3&gt;
