&lt;li&gt;Council member for the Italian Center for Ornithological Studies (&lt;a href=&#34;https://ciso-coi.it/en/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CISO&lt;/a&gt;) from 2019 until 2023.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Council member for the Piedmont Group of Ornithological Studies (&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.gpso.it/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;GPSO&lt;/a&gt;) from 2016 until 2018.&lt;/li&gt;
